#. Referral perk bullet on the introduction referral screen. The referral grant is per day (pro.yml referral.period: 24h).
msgctxt "refer_friends_perks"
msgid "You get +{} GiB/day for life"
msgstr "Bạn nhận được +{} GiB/ngày trọn đời"

#. Referral perk bullet on the introduction referral screen (the referred side). The referral grant is per day (pro.yml referral.period: 24h).
