msgstr "Đã áp dụng tiền thưởng giới thiệu"

#. Body of the one-time full-screen crowning celebration shown to the referrer when a friend joins with their code. {count} is the number of friends that just joined, {data} the daily GiB bonus per referral (currently 3).
msgctxt "referral_celebration_detail"
msgid "A friend just joined URnetwork with your code. You're both earning +{1} GiB a day of free data — for life."
msgid_plural "{0} friends just joined URnetwork with your code. Each one earns you +{1} GiB a day of free data — for life."
msgstr[0] "{0} người bạn vừa tham gia URnetwork bằng mã của bạn. Mỗi người mang lại cho bạn +{1} GiB dữ liệu miễn phí mỗi ngày — trọn đời."

